# SkillTrack 360° 🚀

## Skill-to-Livelihood Outcome Intelligence & Intervention System

> **Don't just track outcomes — understand why they happen, predict risks early, intervene intelligently, and measure the impact.**

SkillTrack 360° is a consent-based, longitudinal skilling outcome tracking and impact-measurement platform designed to connect the complete journey of a trainee:

**Training → Certification → Employment / Self-Employment / Apprenticeship → Verification → Retention → Wage Progression → Skill Gap → Intervention → Impact**

The platform helps governments, training providers, employers, and trainees move beyond basic placement statistics and understand the **real-world impact of skilling programmes**.

