# PART 14 — Risk Engine

```markdown
# 🚨 Early Outcome Risk Engine

## Prototype Approach

For the initial prototype, the Early Outcome Risk Detector can use an explainable rule-based scoring approach.

### Example Rules

| Signal | Example Condition | Risk Contribution |
|---|---|---:|
| Assessment | < 50% | +20 |
| Practical | < 50% | +25 |
| Required Skill | Missing | +20 |
| Interview Readiness | Low | +15 |
| Engagement Signal | Low | +10 |

### Risk Levels

```text
0 – 30     → LOW
31 – 60    → MEDIUM
61 – 100   → HIGH
Risk Score: 78

Main Contributors:
1. Practical performance
2. Missing technical skills
3. Low interview readiness

Recommended Intervention:
1. Practical skill module
2. Industry project
3. Mock interview

